Description: meeting actions from LaTeX reports, in the GNOME top bar
 CyberTodoPunk reads the ACTIONS.tex files that meeting reports (compte
 rendus) include in their action-plan section, and lists the open actions
 owned by the user, one list per company (report folders named
 YYYYMMDD_<COMPANY>_<subject>).
  - A GNOME Shell top-bar "TODO" menu: company switch, one entry per report
    unrolling into its actions, DONE to check one off.
  - Checking an action off writes its completion time into ACTIONS.tex, so
    the next compilation of the report shows when it was done.
  - A GTK 4 / libadwaita window for the list and the settings (full name,
    aliases, search folders, companies), and a command line
    (list, done, reopen, convert, check).
